<title>UK: BTR H1 profit down, payout cut by 28 pct.</title>
<headline>BTR H1 profit down, payout cut by 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)    loss    0.9		    vs 12.5 earnings</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.0		    vs 5.54</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.0		    vs 729</p>
<p> Disposals	loss    228		    vs 41 gain</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,953		  vs 4,892</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts for pre-tax profits were in a range between 604 and 635 million stg, and the dividend was seen between 5.32 and 5.54 pence.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 496		    vs 782</p>
<p> Costs of closures	128		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Interest charge	  116		    vs 78</p>
<p> Tax			  27		     vs 206</p>
<p> Attributable	loss 36		     vs 455 profit</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 29</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 1  Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
